# Stack

- Next.js 16.1.6 App Router, React 19.2.3, TypeScript 5 strict, Tailwind v4, pnpm
- Supabase (`@supabase/ssr`) for Postgres + Auth — no Prisma/Drizzle
- shadcn (radix-vega), react-hook-form + Zod, Resend, Google Maps, sonner
- Auth gate is `proxy.ts` (not `middleware.ts`)
- Alias `@/*` → repo root

**Live tables:** `categories1`, `services1`, `shop_info`, `shop_hours`, `site_announcements`, `gallery_images`, `faqs`

**Live admin:** `/admin/shop-info`, `/admin/categories1`, `/admin/services1`, `/admin/gallery`, `/admin/faq`

**Public:** `/`, `/about`, `/services`, `/gallery`, `/contact`. Login: `/admin/login`

Env names only: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY`, `RESEND_API_KEY`, `OWNER_EMAIL`
